        "text_mYCqz6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Desk job got you down? Craving a healthy dose of movement throughout the day? Don’t fret, we’ve got you covered with the ultimate Cooldown guide to desk job wellness. Revolutionize that desk job and stay fresh and fit, Cooldown style, with these essential wellness tips. </p><h2><strong>1. Virtual Walking Meetings </strong></h2><p>Swap those sit-down meetings for a stroll outside. Grab your phone, catch some vitamin D, and breathe in the fresh air. <a href=\"https://chphealthmt.org/news/what-fresh-air-does-for-your-health\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Getting outside</span></a> is a win-win for your mind and body; boost those happy hormones and melt the stress away. </p>"
